flowchart LR
    root["Genuine Root Authorizer key"]
    ga["Grant gA: Agent A, scope P"]
    gb["Grant gB: A to B, parent gA"]
    gc["Grant gC: B to C, parent gB"]
    gd["Grant gD: C to D, parent gC"]
    independent["Independent root grant gC2: Agent C, scope P"]
    newchild["New explicit C to D grant gD2, parent gC2"]
    revoke["Authenticated root decommissions B or extension revokes gB"]
    invalid["gB and paths gC / gD invalid through that ancestry"]
    valid["Independent gC2 remains valid; gD2 valid if newly authenticated and otherwise permitted"]
    history["Old grants retained; a later root grant does not resurrect old child IDs"]
    root -->|signed issuance| ga
    ga -->|A signature binds scope, B and gA| gb
    gb -->|B signature binds scope, C and gB| gc
    gc -->|C signature binds scope, D and gC| gd
    root -->|separate signed issuance| independent
    independent -->|separate authenticated delegation| newchild
    revoke --> invalid
    gb -. invalidation propagates .-> invalid
    gc -. invalidation propagates .-> invalid
    gd -. invalidation propagates .-> invalid
    independent --> valid
    newchild --> valid
    invalid --> history
    subgraph evidence["Two distinct evidence layers"]
        offchain["Python: verify retained signatures and current local status"]
        onchain["Local-only GrantAuthority: root-attested immutable parents, wasValidAt and isValidNow"]
    end
    history --> offchain
    history -. for previously anchored grants .-> onchain
